# Puppet Crafting: "Enchanted permanent is a Construct creature with base power and toughness 5/5 in addition to its other types."
# Bot1's Mox Jet (a noncreature artifact, no power or toughness) becomes a 5/5: it is still an artifact (the "in addition"), is now also
# a creature (layer 4) and a Construct, and has base 5/5 (layer 7b). The Aura is attached to it. Mox Emerald and Mox Jet pay {1}{G}
# (the Jet tapped for mana first, then enchanted).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Puppet Crafting
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Puppet Crafting.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Power = 5
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Toughness = 5

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Subtypes = Construct
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Puppet Crafting.AttachedTo = Mox Jet
